# =============================================================================
# Oxidized — Fallback Device List (router.db)
# Format: hostname:model:ip
#
# This file is the FALLBACK source used only when NetBox is unreachable.
# Under normal operation, Oxidized reads its device list from the NetBox API.
#
# Once you run the netbox_populate.yml playbook, all devices will be in NetBox
# and this file becomes purely a safety net.
#
# To switch to this source, edit oxidized/config and swap the source block
# (instructions are in the config file comments).
# =============================================================================

